    "detailed_description": "<h1>PLAY THE DEMO!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/e3c4816d6026e35c20d3b69123d863c6.avif?t=1737243949\" width=616 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the opening hours of the game and explore its core mechanics!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>PEACE BREEDS COMPLACENCY</u></i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When royal guards Frey and Kyslar attend the prince's wedding, they expect nothing more than a peaceful ceremony. But amidst the celebration, dark omens are ignored.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the kingdom descends into turmoil, they cling to the last glimmers of hope, seeking the truth to prevent an inevitable war. What begins as a routine event soon pulls Frey, Kyslar, and a group of outcasts, between pirates and prisoners, into a conflict that has been quietly brewing for far too long. Now, they must rise as unlikely heroes to confront the forces threatening to tear their world apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/ed83fcffdb9db20aca79438babe7b9af.poster.avif?t=1737243949\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/ed83fcffdb9db20aca79438babe7b9af.webm?t=1737243949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/ed83fcffdb9db20aca79438babe7b9af.mp4?t=1737243949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>START FROM SCRATCH AND BECOME A HERO WITH TACTICAL RPG COMBAT</u></i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dive into intense JRPG tactical combat, where every action can alter the course of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Master diverse magic types and unleash unique abilities for each character as you navigate a war-torn world filled with peril. Face challenging foes, where even the smallest enemy can deal devastating blows, and carve your path to victory in a land where every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/3868660307d2c2dffd23f5826568aaa7.poster.avif?t=1737243949\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/3868660307d2c2dffd23f5826568aaa7.webm?t=1737243949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/3868660307d2c2dffd23f5826568aaa7.mp4?t=1737243949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>UNLIMITED ADVENTURE</u></i></strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure across a vibrant fantasy island and uncover all it has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unforgettable moments await at every turn, with exciting activities like Blackjack, Fishing, and Whack-a-Mole, along with side quests that can even influence the main storyline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/dd38769bb754ee5f2684d0c7b09edad0.poster.avif?t=1737243949\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/dd38769bb754ee5f2684d0c7b09edad0.webm?t=1737243949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/dd38769bb754ee5f2684d0c7b09edad0.mp4?t=1737243949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Key Features:</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>7-10 hours of playtime</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a captivating experience with a playtime that keeps you engaged from start to finish, in a game that aims to have engaging hours instead of a prolonged void time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unravel the mystery behind the attack on a royal wedding</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to uncover secrets and save a kingdom teetering on the edge of ruin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Revamped turn-based combat</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a dynamic turn-based battle system, enhanced with Quick Time Events, to boost your attack, and dodge enemy attacks, keeping every encounter exciting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Strategic status effects</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply statuses and debuffs that even work on bosses, adding depth to your combat strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Branching side quests</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete side quests that can directly influence and alter the main story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Multiple routes and endings</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the main narrative with 3 distinct routes and uncover 9 different endings based on your choices.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>PEACE BREEDS COMPLACENCY</u></i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When royal guards Frey and Kyslar attend the prince's wedding, they expect nothing more than a peaceful ceremony. But amidst the celebration, dark omens are ignored.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the kingdom descends into turmoil, they cling to the last glimmers of hope, seeking the truth to prevent an inevitable war. What begins as a routine event soon pulls Frey, Kyslar, and a group of outcasts, between pirates and prisoners, into a conflict that has been quietly brewing for far too long. Now, they must rise as unlikely heroes to confront the forces threatening to tear their world apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/ed83fcffdb9db20aca79438babe7b9af.poster.avif?t=1737243949\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/ed83fcffdb9db20aca79438babe7b9af.webm?t=1737243949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/ed83fcffdb9db20aca79438babe7b9af.mp4?t=1737243949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>START FROM SCRATCH AND BECOME A HERO WITH TACTICAL RPG COMBAT</u></i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dive into intense JRPG tactical combat, where every action can alter the course of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Master diverse magic types and unleash unique abilities for each character as you navigate a war-torn world filled with peril. Face challenging foes, where even the smallest enemy can deal devastating blows, and carve your path to victory in a land where every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/3868660307d2c2dffd23f5826568aaa7.poster.avif?t=1737243949\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/3868660307d2c2dffd23f5826568aaa7.webm?t=1737243949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/3868660307d2c2dffd23f5826568aaa7.mp4?t=1737243949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>UNLIMITED ADVENTURE</u></i></strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure across a vibrant fantasy island and uncover all it has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unforgettable moments await at every turn, with exciting activities like Blackjack, Fishing, and Whack-a-Mole, along with side quests that can even influence the main storyline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/dd38769bb754ee5f2684d0c7b09edad0.poster.avif?t=1737243949\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/dd38769bb754ee5f2684d0c7b09edad0.webm?t=1737243949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870560/extras/dd38769bb754ee5f2684d0c7b09edad0.mp4?t=1737243949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Key Features:</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>7-10 hours of playtime</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a captivating experience with a playtime that keeps you engaged from start to finish, in a game that aims to have engaging hours instead of a prolonged void time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unravel the mystery behind the attack on a royal wedding</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to uncover secrets and save a kingdom teetering on the edge of ruin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Revamped turn-based combat</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a dynamic turn-based battle system, enhanced with Quick Time Events, to boost your attack, and dodge enemy attacks, keeping every encounter exciting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Strategic status effects</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply statuses and debuffs that even work on bosses, adding depth to your combat strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Branching side quests</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete side quests that can directly influence and alter the main story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Multiple routes and endings</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the main narrative with 3 distinct routes and uncover 9 different endings based on your choices.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Fading Voices plays like Final Fantasy + Like a Dragon. Explore twisting caverns and dense forests, squaring up against filthy creatures, bizarre monsters, and elite soldiers across a vast island at war in turn-based tactical combat, and decide the story with a few key decisions.",
